  <summary>How the example turns a Common Docs tree into a site plus feeds and an agent-API.</summary>
  <content type="html">&lt;span id=&quot;overview&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The site is a static Astro + Starlight build driven entirely by the &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;docs/&lt;/code&gt;
tree.&lt;/p&gt;
