&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metadata-driven&lt;/strong&gt; — nav, feeds, and the agent-API all read from frontmatter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Convention-first&lt;/strong&gt; — the &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;docs/&lt;/code&gt; tree is a valid OKF bundle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See the toolkit’s own architecture docs for the internals.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
